
---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="About | Guanche Warriors">
	<article class="about-page">

		<header class="about-header">
			<span class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE GAME</span>

			<h1>A World Between Two Realms</h1>

			<p>
				Guanche Warriors is an independent 2.5D turn-based JRPG
				inspired by the Canary Islands.
			</p>
		</header>

		<section class="about-section">
			<h2>The World</h2>

			<p>
				Discover a world inspired by the landscapes,
				culture and heritage of the Canary Islands.
			</p>

			<p>
				Eight warriors, representing eight islands,
				will explore a world where physical and
				spiritual dimensions are deeply connected.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="about-section">
			<h2>Core Features</h2>

			<ul>
				<li>Classic turn-based combat.</li>
				<li>A party of four characters.</li>
				<li>Physical and spiritual world exploration.</li>
				<li>Character transformations and progression.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="about-section">
			<h2>Development Journey</h2>

			<p>
				Guanche Warriors is currently in early development,
				with a focus on building its core gameplay systems
				and working towards a playable demo.
			</p>

			<a href="/devlog/">Follow the Development Journal →</a>
		</section>

	</article>
</MainLayout>

<style>
	.about-page {
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 80px 40px;
	}

	.about-header {
		margin-bottom: 70px;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		color: #d69b48;
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: bold;
		letter-spacing: 3px;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);
		line-height: 1.2;
		margin: 20px 0;
	}

	.about-header p {
		color: #aeb5b9;
		font-size: 19px;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.about-section {
		margin-bottom: 64px;
	}

	h2 {
		color: #d69b48;
		font-size: 28px;
	}

	.about-section p,
	.about-section li {
		color: #c5c9c6;
		line-height: 1.9;
	}

	.about-section a {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 20px;
		color: #d69b48;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.about-page {
			padding: 50px 20px;
		}
	}
</style>
